SUMMARY:Spirits of Crestview Guided Stroll
LOCATION:Main Street\, Downtown Crestview\, Main Street\, Crestview\, FL 32
 536
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 10/29 · 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM (moved from 10/22)\n\nThe 
 mayor's cultural program turns Main Street into a living museum where cost
 umed guides introduce figures from Crestview's history\, including the own
 er of a local Coney Island stand and the city's first librarian. Tour grou
 ps leave every 15 minutes from 6:00 PM and the last group departs at 7:45 
 PM\, and each walk takes 45 minutes to an hour. Space in each group is lim
 ited\, so a spot has to be booked ahead.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nD
 etails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-spirits-of-crestview-walkin
 g-tour-1022.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-spirits-of-crestview-walking-tou
 r-1022.html
CATEGORIES:Town and community
