 tume contest that ends with an awards ceremony. Registration for the costu
 me contest closes at 5:45 PM\, so families who want to enter should arrive
  early. This is one of several Halloween-season events OWA is running thro
 ugh the end of October.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://c
