 , Fort Walton Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 8:00 AM to 10:00 AM\n\nThe City of Fort Walto
 n Beach has rescheduled its Ferry Park community cleanup to Saturday Octob
 er 31. Volunteers gather at the Hughes Street entrance near the pickleball
  courts for a short briefing at 8:00 AM and then split into small groups. 
 The city provides some equipment and asks volunteers to bring a rake and a
  cardboard box if they have them.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails:
