DESCRIPTION:Friday 12/4 · 6:00 PM\n\nThe City of Foley opens its holiday s
 eason with Christmas in the Park at Heritage Park\, where the crowd sings 
 carols\, watches the city Christmas tree get lit and visits with Santa. Ho
 t cocoa and snacks are served\, and the Christmas Tree Decorating Contest 
 awards are handed out during the evening. Admission is free\, and the ligh
 ting makes an easy kickoff to the Let It Snow marketplace and parade the n
 ext morning.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/event
