DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:MoonPie Over Mobile New Year's Eve
LOCATION:Downtown Mobile: Mardi Gras Park and main stage\, Downtown Mobile\
 , AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 12/31 · New Year's Eve · times not posted yet\n\nDow
 ntown Mobile rings in the new year by lowering a giant electric MoonPie fr
 om the RSA Trustmark building at midnight. The 2026 celebration is on\, an
 d its music lineup was due to be announced on September 15. The night's fu
 ll schedule is not posted yet. Last year it opened at 11 AM with a kids zo
 ne in Mardi Gras Park and a noon drop for children.\n\nPrice: No published
  price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-moonpie-over-mob
 ile-1231.html
