UID:ev_historic_mobile_hidden_history_lecture_0221-2027-02-21@coastaleventu
 res.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270221
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270222
SUMMARY:Mobile's Hidden History lecture at Oakleigh
LOCATION:Historic Oakleigh\, Cox-Deasy Cottage\, 350 Oakleigh Pl\, Mobile\,
  AL 36604
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 2/21 · afternoon\n\nAuthor and former radio host Joe Cu
 haj tells forgotten stories of Mobile history at Historic Oakleigh\, inclu
 ding the earliest days of baseball in the city in the 1860s and legends th
 at sound too unlikely to be true. Seating is limited. Historic Mobile Pres
 ervation Society members attend free.\n\nPrice: from $10\n\nDetails: https
 ://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-historic-mobile-hidden-history-lecture-0
 221.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-historic-mobile-hidden-history-l
 ecture-0221.html
CATEGORIES:Town and community
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
